  "details": "I would like to suggest addition to eyetracking panel on 3.0 avatar descriptor. I've noticed recent'ish trend how some avatar creators have shapekey movement for eyes in all 4 directions.\nWould it be possible to add shapekey movement also for left and right eye movement alongside previous up and down?\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/426814426520354821/851531339920572476/unknown.png\nEspecially since shapekey movement sometimes seems better than what bone movement provided given example below.\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/426814426520354821/851532167909736508/unknown.png\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/426814426520354821/851532173621198878/unknown.png",
